        },
        {
          "text": "ak kele kibwat ak kerib betusiechoto eng’ ibinda age tugul, ak eng’ gab chi age tugul, eng’ emet age tugul, ak eng’ nganaset age tugul; si mabetyo betusiekab Purim eng’ Yahudik, anan kobet kabwatenywa eng’ iyotenywa.",
          "type": "text",
