        {
          "text": "si kogimit betusiechuto bo Purim eng’ betusiekwak che kiging’at, ko u ye kiga ng’at ichek Mordekai Yahudiot, ak Esta osotiotab laitoriat, ak ko u ye kiga kong’atyigei ak iyotenywa, eng’ ng’olyotab karugutetab ge ak rirekwak, ",
